{"availability":"available","full":"emibcn/covid","name":"covid","description":"Progressive Web Application that displays extracted data from the official web https://dadescovid.cat","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":9,"forks":20,"created":"2020-09-23T23:44:27Z","updated":"2026-06-30T20:17:16Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://emibcn.github.io/covid/","topics":["catalunya","climate-change","covid","covid-19","covid-data","create-react-app","frontend","github-page","hacktoberfest","javascript","reactjs","visual-widgets","web-scraping","webapp","widgets","workflow"],"demo":"https://emibcn.github.io/covid/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T13:39:41.731Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T13:39:41.731Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T13:39:41.731Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T13:39:41.731Z","stars":9,"forks":20}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This applications displays public information about Covid19 Pandemy in Catalonia, extracted from the official webs and Seguiment Covid19 BCN.","The aim of this application is to display the data in different ways than the originals, improving performance and adding more value to it, trying to help the users to better understand the situation and evolution of the Covid-19 pandemic in the region of Catalunya (Catalonia)."],"features":["This application does not use any tracking system by itself, only the ones that could use GitHub Pages (they own the servers, they know the client IP). This means I have no feedback of the use of the app, so let a star…","The application lets you add more visual widgets into the grid/dashboard. The configuration of those widgets is saved in the location of the web browser (the hash), so you can undo or go back easily with native browser…","Each widget have a menu button where you can find its actions: Edit, Remove and Legend. Those actions open a dialog to show information to you or let you change some parameters.","There is a Slider with a Play/Pause button to handle the day the data is shown for. The Play/Pause button enables/disables the automatic day increase and restart, helping you to see time-based correlations.","The application automatically detects when the used data has been updated and need to be redownloaded, and when the application itself has been updated, and notifies the user to apply the updates."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/emibcn/covid/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"c08386c5a14f0fb2e8e46a3267d8fed6b734e1fa0603904f42d1d71d1e4a2e35","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T13:39:41.897Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T13:39:41.897Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This applications displays public information about Covid19 Pandemy in Catalonia, extracted from the official webs and Seguiment Covid19 BCN.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/emibcn/covid/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c08386c5a14f0fb2e8e46a3267d8fed6b734e1fa0603904f42d1d71d1e4a2e35","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/emibcn/covid/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T13:39:41.898Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-30T20:17:16Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/emibcn/covid/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T13:39:41.901Z","hash":"c08386c5a14f0fb2e8e46a3267d8fed6b734e1fa0603904f42d1d71d1e4a2e35","originalBytes":13515,"storedBytes":13515,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["data","app","add","application","github","project","there","backend","code","one","been","button","contributing","covid-data","frontend","let","open","own","pages","released","servers","those","under","widgets","barcelona","because","browser","charts","come","day","disclaimer","issue","know","maps","public","some","they","translation","updated","used","web","when","work","workflow","about","adding","applications","back","catalunya","commons","configuration","contributor","docu